    "Collect the latest crash report to share with the developer when reporting lock screen or overlay issues.": {
      "comment": "A footer for the \"Diagnostics\" section of the lock screen settings.",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Při hlášení problémů s uzamčenou obrazovkou nebo překryvem shromážděte nejnovější zprávu o selhání, kterou můžete sdílet s vývojářem."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sammeln Sie den neuesten Absturzbericht, um es mit dem Entwickler zu teilen, wenn Sie Probleme mit dem Sperrbildschirm oder der Überlagerung melden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Collect the latest crash report to share with the developer when reporting lock screen or overlay issues."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recueillez le dernier rapport de crash à partager avec le développeur lorsque vous signalez les problèmes d'écran de verrouillage ou de superposition."
          }
        },
        "gu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "잠금 화면 또는 오버레이 문제 발생 시 개발자와 공유할 최신 충돌 보고서를 수집하십시오."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hent den nyeste krasjrapporten for å dele den med utvikleren når du rapporterer problemer med låseskjermen eller overlegget."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Соберите последний отчет о сбое для разработчика."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Зберіть останній звіт про збій, щоб поділитися ним із розробником під час повідомлення про проблеми із екраном блокування або накладенням."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收集最新崩溃报告以便向开发者报告锁屏或覆盖层问题时分享。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เก็บรายงานข้อขัดข้องล่าสุดเพื่อแชร์กับนักพัฒนาเมื่อรายงานปัญหาหน้าจอล็อกหรือโอเวอร์เลย์"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verzamel het laatste crashrapport om te delen met de ontwikkelaar bij het melden van problemen met het vergrendelscherm of de overlay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color options control the icon and progress bar appearance. Auto adapts to system theme.": {
      "comment": "A description under the \"Appearance\" section of the Custom OSD settings, explaining that the color options control the icon and progress bar appearance, and that \"Auto\" automatically adapts to the system theme.",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Možnosti barev ovládají vzhled ikon a ukazatele průběhu. Automaticky se přizpůsobí motivu systému."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Farboptionen steuern das Erscheinungsbild des Symbols und des Fortschrittsbalkens. Automatische Anpassung an das Systemthema."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Color options control the icon and progress bar appearance. Auto adapts to system theme."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les options de couleur contrôlent l'icône et l'apparence de la barre de progression. S'adapte automatiquement au thème du système."
          }
        },
        "gu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "रंग विकल्प आइकन और प्रगति पट्टी की उपस्थिति को नियंत्रित करते हैं। स्वचालित रूप से सिस्टम थीम के अनुसार अनुकूलित हो जाता है।"
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "색상 옵션은 아이콘과 진행률 표시줄의 모양을 제어합니다. 자동으로 시스템 테마에 맞춰집니다."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fargevalg styrer utseendet på ikonet og fremdriftslinjen. Auto tilpasser seg systemets tema."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Настройки цвета влияют на иконку и индикатор. Автоматически адаптируется под тему."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "வண்ண விருப்பங்கள் ஐகான் மற்றும் முன்னேற்றப் பட்டையின் தோற்றத்தைக் கட்டுப்படுத்துகின்றன. தானாகவே கணினி கருப்பொருளுக்கு ஏற்ப மாற்றியமைத்துக் கொள்ளும்."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色选项控制图标和进度条外观。自动适应系统主题。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ตัวเลือกสีควบคุมลักษณะไอคอนและแถบความคืบหน้า อัตโนมัติปรับตามธีมระบบ"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kleuropties bepalen het pictogram en het uiterlijk van de voortgangsbalk. Past zich automatisch aan het systeemthema aan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color-coded battery display": {
